WHAT THIS COVERS

The derived datasets and written content in this repository, including:

  - niw-decisions.json      parsed index of USCIS AAO non-precedent decisions
  - vb_history.json         Visa Bulletin cutoff history
  - perm_history.json       DOL PERM quarterly processing history
  - eb_inventory.json       USCIS pending I-485 inventory series
  - rulebook.json           the process rulebook and its sourced notes
