ON THE UNDERLYING SOURCES

The federal government works these datasets are derived FROM are in the public
domain and are not claimed here: the Department of State Visa Bulletin, DOL PERM
disclosure files, USCIS Administrative Appeals Office decisions, USCIS inventory
data, the Federal Register, and the eCFR. What is licensed here is the parsing,
structuring, and presentation of that material, not the underlying documents.

Because every parsed field records the span of source text it was extracted
from, any row can be audited against the original government PDF. If you find a
discrepancy, the source document governs, not this dataset.

